{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">深圳皇崗海關人員近日在福田口岸，截獲23件禁止出境的文物。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.CUSTOMS-1600.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026EAucsANwcb1790942359.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.CUSTOMS-1600.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">海關總署上載片段，一名身穿黑色衫男子在福田口岸出境時，被海關關員攔截檢查，當局在其行李查獲多件物品用發泡膠及膠帶包裹。經專業機構鑒定，這批物品包括從唐朝到清朝的瓷器、硯台等禁止出境文物。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T12:40:24.570348+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}